# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets SPA fallback.
#
# NOTE: no catch-all (`/*`) rule here on purpose. The worker config
# (wrangler.jsonc) already sets assets.not_found_handling to
# "single-page-application", which serves index.html for every unknown
# route. A catch-all _redirects rule on top of that is rejected as an
# infinite loop (Cloudflare error 100324).
/guide  /index.html  200
/about  /index.html  200
